    "content": "## First impressions\nQuite smoky and dark, with a mysterious masculine character. The woody side comes through strongly, moving into a warm resinous incense based spice. It feels quite sexy, very dark and not sweet at all.\n## Notes\n- Testing on 9 July 2026\n- Corrected listed profile: cypress opening, vetiver heart, cashmeran and musk base\n- Adam’s impression still reads as smoky, dark, woody, resinous, incense leaning, spicy and masculine\n- Added impression: there is a detectable freshness, definitely cypress like green sap. It feels almost green dark and has a pine like resemblance.\n- Likely best suited to cooler weather, night wear, formal settings and date night",
