  "title": "Men's Style & Color Theory Tips",
  "date": "2026-07-03",
  "sourceUrl": "https://app.notion.com/p/308f794f84768019829fd05b338321c8#392f794f847680d2a73afab7bb466e98",
  "summary": "### Color Combinations & Pairings\n- **Neutral base swaps** change the entire feel of an outfit: [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680aebf9bd0c02525d2c1] [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f8476801890a0ed62e460561b]\n\t- Chocolate with cream → luxury; with black → expensive\n\t- Burgundy with cream → classic; with black → powerful [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f84768085baa2e03e5b650491]\n\t- Camel with cream → effortless; with black → elevated\n- **Upgrading basics with a third color** adds sophistication: [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680699a26df93ff88d9f3]\n\t- Navy + white is good, but add cream → old money\n\t- Cream + olive green is nice, but add chocolate → chic\n\t- Black + white is timeless, but add camel → luxurious [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680a5a919e3eca19b2114]\n- **Bold color pairings** for a more artistic or intentional look: [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680629580e8c5bc52e7b2]\n\t- Gray + blue + red → intentional\n\t- White + cream + cognac → expensive\n\t- Powder blue + white + merlot → luxurious\n- **Terracotta, pistachio, and mustard pairings:** [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f84768081a238fb6ac11fba5b]\n\t- Terracotta orange + Tiffany blue → artistic\n\t- Pistachio green + chocolate brown → richer\n\t- Mustard yellow + fuchsia pink → striking\n### Outfit Elevation: Adding a Third Piece\n- A third item transforms a safe outfit into a styled one: [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f8476801692b5f3bc8815691c]\n\t- White t-shirt + blue jeans → add camo overshirt + white sneakers for intention\n\t- Cream Henley + dark jeans → add tan suede jacket for expensive feel\n\t- Gray sweater + black pants → add camel coat + black Chelsea boots for sophistication\n- Elevate basics with structured bags and quality footwear first [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680a498f5e2362a006b08]\n### Color Theory Fundamentals\n- **Complementary colors** (opposite on the color wheel) create contrast — e.g., blue and brown [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680588c29cd45c42a97ce]\n- **Triadic colors** (equally spaced on the wheel) add contrast while maintaining harmony — e.g., blue, brown, and green [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680f6a4c3d9b5ee6ee33c]\n- When using triadic looks, choose a darker shade of one color to add contrast while maintaining overall harmony [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680f6a4c3d9b5ee6ee33c]\n### Clothing Details That Look Cheap\n- **Collar + tie + lapel proportions** must be balanced — skinny shirt collars are the main culprit of imbalance [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f84768085acf2f8f4210fe841] [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680a3bb9cd6e47e948221]\n- **Single-vent jackets** are associated with mass production; opt for **double vents** for a higher-end, British tailoring aesthetic [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680a3bb9cd6e47e948221]\n- **Stretchy synthetic trousers** (e.g., Lululemon ABC pant) may look like chinos but undermine a polished appearance [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680b3b590f398fe0e040f]\n### Monochromatic Outfits: 3 Key Rules\n- **Contrast is essential** — avoid wearing the exact same shade head to toe; branch into different shades and tones of one color [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680b3b590f398fe0e040f]\n- **Texture defines the body** — incorporate suede, leather, denim, or chunky knit to add visual depth and prevent a flat look [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f84768044ae1dfe393fd0521e]\n- **Patterns are allowed** — adding patterns within the same color palette adds visual interest and highlights different parts of the body [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f84768044ae1dfe393fd0521e]\n### How to Dress Better: 5 Steps\n- **Know your body type** — e.g., high-waisted trousers for shorter legs; structured shoulders to accentuate the upper body [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f847680099247f5a64e0879b5]\n- **Build good basics that fit well** — plain t-shirts, jeans, smart trousers, knitwear, a quality coat; invest in timeless, versatile pieces first [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f84768038ba99c0ef51f2a9fa]\n- **Elevate your shoe game** — two pairs of sneakers and two pairs of dress shoes covers the essentials [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f84768038ba99c0ef51f2a9fa]\n- **Layer your outfits** — easy in fall/winter, but also achievable in summer (e.g., tank top under a lightweight shirt) [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f84768038ba99c0ef51f2a9fa]\n- **Attend to small details** — well-ironed shirts, polished shoes, and a lint roller make a significant difference [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f8476804db9fde6a3073101a6]\n### Assembling an Outfit: Top 3 Tips\n- **Include light, mid, and dark tones** — ensures balance and visual appeal; prevents outfits from looking one-note [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f8476804dad10edfd4220a96c]\n- **Add at least one pattern or texture** — breaks up solid colors and adds tactile interest [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f8476804dad10edfd4220a96c]\n- **Build to at least five pieces** — if starting with t-shirt, jeans, and sneakers, add an overlayer and an accessory (or two accessories in warm weather) to create a cohesive, intentional look [^https://app.notion.com/p/392f794f8476802ea9f9d06c30e34694#392f794f84768000858ef2a528805c42]",
